  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "sceneId": "home",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_01.mp3",
      "text": "欢迎来到 KTUI Gallery 实机演示！这是一套完全对标 Windows 11 WinUI 3 与 Fluent 2 设计规范的 C++20 桌面控件库。",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 11.222,
      "startFrame": 10,
      "durationFrames": 326
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "sceneId": "home",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_02.mp3",
      "text": "首先可以看到整体的云母材质层次、统一的微圆角卡片与极细高光描边；点击右上角主题按钮，还能体验无撕裂的圆形涟漪深浅主题切换。",
      "start": 11.422,
      "end": 23.11,
      "startFrame": 343,
      "durationFrames": 351
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "sceneId": "button",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_03.mp3",
      "text": "进入基础输入，先看按钮家族。标准按钮、强调色主按钮与危险操作按钮层级分明，每个圆角边框都由解析 SDF 实时绘制。",
      "start": 23.46,
      "end": 35.196,
      "startFrame": 704,
      "durationFrames": 352
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "sceneId": "button",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_04.mp3",
      "text": "针对高危操作，还内置了 HoldConfirmButton，需要长按填满进度后才触发确认，优雅防误触。",
      "start": 35.396,
      "end": 43.172,
      "startFrame": 1062,
      "durationFrames": 233
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "sceneId": "toggle",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_05.mp3",
      "text": "再来看状态切换控件。ToggleSwitch 拨动时搭载了弹簧物理动效，圆球会在按压与滑动时产生细腻的弹性形变。",
      "start": 43.522,
      "end": 53.218,
      "startFrame": 1306,
      "durationFrames": 291
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "sceneId": "toggle",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_06.mp3",
      "text": "CheckBox 则严格还原 Fluent 2 勾选与三态视觉反馈，悬停和点击过渡顺滑自然。",
      "start": 53.418,
      "end": 60.69,
      "startFrame": 1603,
      "durationFrames": 218
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "sceneId": "slider",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_07.mp3",
      "text": "Slider 滑块在拖动时，内芯会自动微缩放，进度轨道实时响应。",
      "start": 61.04,
      "end": 66.92,
      "startFrame": 1831,
      "durationFrames": 176
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "sceneId": "slider",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_08.mp3",
      "text": "得益于底层十六乘十六脏瓦片剔除，即使高频拖拽，整屏也只有滑块附近的极少数瓦片在重绘。",
      "start": 67.12,
      "end": 75.472,
      "startFrame": 2014,
      "durationFrames": 251
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "sceneId": "color",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_09.mp3",
      "text": "像 ColorPicker 这样的复杂图形控件，同样不依赖任何贴图资源，色盘、色相条与预览色块全部由计算着色器实时渲染。",
      "start": 75.822,
      "end": 86.046,
      "startFrame": 2275,
      "durationFrames": 307
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "sceneId": "text",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_10.mp3",
      "text": "来到文本输入区。点击 TextBox 聚焦，底部会浮现经典的 Fluent 2 强调色聚焦条，字体直接桥接 Windows DirectWrite 原生引擎，清晰锐利且完整支持输入法。",
      "start": 86.396,
      "end": 100.196,
      "startFrame": 2592,
      "durationFrames": 414
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "sceneId": "dock_data",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_11.mp3",
      "text": "面向专业桌面软件，KTUI 提供了类似 Visual Studio 风格的 DockPanel 拖拽停靠布局，以及支持流畅滚轮浏览的高性能 DataGrid 数据表格。",
      "start": 100.546,
      "end": 112.09,
      "startFrame": 3016,
      "durationFrames": 346
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "sceneId": "feedback",
      "file": "showcase_audio/sc_12.mp3",
      "text": "最后看反馈体系：Toast 浮层通知使用单遍解析高斯阴影营造立体景深，而 ProgressRing 则以丝滑的无锯齿动画呈现加载状态。",
      "start": 112.44,
      "end": 123.504,
      "startFrame": 3373,
      "durationFrames": 332
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
